{
  "game": "plinko",
  "note": "belt-and-braces for the ack-then-push shape: a settled-WORD payload without a payout leg still becomes a (payout-less) round, and the payout-bearing settle 2s later must UPGRADE it (event.upgrade) instead of being deduped away by the same-id memory",
  "steps": [
    {
      "transport": "direct",
      "kind": "fetch",
